::MCQ::
How should module names typically be formatted?
{
~ PascalCase
~ camelCase
~ UPPERCASE
= snake_case
}

::MCQ::
Which of the following is a valid way to import a specific function from a module?
{
~ import module.function
= from module import function
~ use module.function
~ include module function
}

::MCQ::
What is the purpose of using an alias when importing?
{
~ To rename the module permanently
~ To reduce import time
= To simplify long module or function names
~ To hide the module's contents
}

::MCQ::
The __name__ attribute is always set to the module's filename.
{
~ True
= False
}

::MCQ::
Modules can only contain functions.
{
~ True
= False
}
